menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_PLAYBACK_REQUEST
    bool "Enable on-demand playback request cache"
    default y
    help
        Caches a bounded list of the guardian's on-demand playback requests so
        the device can drain them in order and report each request's terminal
        outcome, staying consistent with the parent app's playback view
        (/api/v1/playback/requests).

endmenu
